<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n39339" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπιείσομαι</span></b> , <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπιεισάμενος</span></b> , only fut. and aor.,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>rush, hasten to</i> or
				<i>against</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοὺς ἄλλους ἐπιείσομαι, ὅν κε κιχείω</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					11.367
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀγροὺς ἐπιείσομαι</span>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἠδὲ βοτῆρας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
					15.504
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπιεισαμένη πρὸς στήθεα χειρὶ
				παχείῃ</span>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἤλασε</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					21.424
				</span></i>
			 (
				v.l.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπερεισαμένη</span>
			). (Cf. 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ε᾽ἴσομαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					11
				</span></i>
			: perh. fut. and aor. of (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπι-</span>)<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ʽϝ̔̓<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ίεμαι</span></span>.)</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
